comment.narrative:
GoI endorsed Security Sector Reform Programme is in place with working methods for implementation agreed. 

SSRP implementation mechanisms consisting of the 7 systems of which 2 are fully operational.

1): Criminal Justice and Law Enforcement; and Critical Infrastructure Protection (CIP) system priorities are fully operational; 

2): Defence and Internal Security Strategy, National Security Architecture, National Security Legislation; and Intelligence Community are partially operational & remain weak; 

3): Due to prolonged formation of the new Government work on the Democratic oversight priority was stalled. 

However, SDC by-laws were endorsed by the Parliament in February 2018.
